==Trivia==
*Please Open the Country's Japanese name, Kaikoku Shite Kudasai (開国してください, "Please Open the Country"), is a memetic quote by [[wikipedia:ja:宮崎吐夢|Tomu Miyazaki]]'s portrayal of [[wikipedia:Matthew C. Perry|Matthew Perry]] in ''[https://dic.pixiv.net/a/ペリーのお願い Perry no Onegai]'', (ペリーのお願い, "Perry's Request"), an audio work in the "Saruyama Hage no Jo Hour" (さるやまハゲの助アワー) part of the CD included with the February 1998 issue of the magazine ''[[wikipedia:テックウィンDVD|TECH Win]]''. During the golden age of Flash, ''Perry no Onegai'' became famous as a subject of [https://youtu.be/I8jJ5PK9kj4 Flash animations].

